<title>MOLDOVA: MOLDOVAN LEU STEADY AT 4.599 PER DOLLAR.</title>
<headline>MOLDOVAN LEU STEADY AT 4.599 PER DOLLAR.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu remained   </p>
<p>at 4.599 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank </p>
<p>Currency Exchange, unchanged from from April 7.</p>
<p>				   April 9	 April 7		    </p>
<p>lei per dollar		 4.599	   4.599			</p>
<p>volume traded ($)	    50,000	  135,000		    </p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
